DataCalcInsightTemplate.expression:
SELECT
    {Source:Individual__dlm}.{Source_Field:ssot__Id__c} AS {CI_Target_Field:IndividualId__c},
    AVG({Source:Individual__dlm}.{Source_Field:Purchase_Amount__c}) AS {CI_Target_Field:AvgPurchaseAmount__c},
    COUNT({Source:Individual__dlm}.{Source_Field:ssot__Id__c}) AS {CI_Target_Field:PurchaseCount__c}
FROM
    {Source:ssot__Individual__dlm} AS {Source:Individual__dlm}
GROUP BY
    {Source:Individual__dlm}.{Source_Field:ssot__Id__c}
